00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.463
You know, I gotta be kind

00:02:48.463 --> 00:02:49.602
to the stuffed animals.
- My daughter does that. Okay.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.930
- I lined them up and
then being like my, what,

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:54.080
like, eight year old, nine year old self

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.870
who obviously knows about heartbreak,

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.431
I would sing them Adele.

00:02:57.431 --> 00:02:58.264
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:58.264 --> 00:03:00.770
- The most disappointing and
defeating part of the story

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:01.603
