00:03:01.603 --> 00:03:03.373
"When I was a child listening to Adele."

00:03:03.373 --> 00:03:05.500
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.740
Because, well...

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:07.640
- I understand.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:08.473
- I was not.

00:03:08.473 --> 00:03:09.610
All right. Here we go.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:10.443
Boom.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.360
Never have I ever

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.420
broken a bone.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.487
Ooh, I have never.

00:03:16.487 --> 00:03:17.800
- I have never, either.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.970
- I have bent a bone. Two.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.130
- What did you do?

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.100
- I have fallen off a
horse and bent my tailbone

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.560
