00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.870
I was in a bike accident.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:33.703
And I...

00:03:33.703 --> 00:03:34.610
Yeah, it's bent.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.070
