00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.960
Totally dislocated some stuff.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:52.793
- Oh.
- But I think

00:03:52.793 --> 00:03:54.100
I was doing a favor to my mom.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.390
