00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:56.410
- Yeah.
- Keeping things interesting.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.200
Like, how boring would it be
if I didn't do that stuff?

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:59.865
- You're a half glass full kind of girl.

00:03:59.865 --> 00:04:00.698
- Yeah.

00:04:00.698 --> 00:04:01.531
(Kelly laughs)

00:04:01.531 --> 00:04:02.390
- Yeah.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.947
I am so glad you're
sticking around. I love you.

00:04:04.947 --> 00:04:07.080
